{
  "type": "View",
  "id": "reference_test_tooling_root",
  "orientation": "vertical",
  "width": "matchParent",
  "height": "matchParent",
  "background": "#F9FAFB",
  "child": [
    {
      "data": [
        {
          "name": "nextReadLinks",
          "class": "CollectionDataSource"
        },
        {
          "name": "onNavigateReference",
          "class": "() -> Void"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "Scroll",
      "id": "reference_test_tooling_scroll",
      "width": "matchParent",
      "weight": 1,
      "child": [
        {
          "type": "View",
          "orientation": "vertical",
          "id": "reference_test_tooling_header",
          "width": "matchParent",
          "height": "wrapContent",
          "paddings": [24, 32, 24, 32],
          "child": [
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "width": "wrapContent",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "semibold",
              "fontColor": "#64748B",
              "tapBackground": "#F3F4F6",
              "onClick": "@{onNavigateReference}",
              "text": "breadcrumb"
            },
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "width": "matchParent",
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "topMargin": 16,
              "fontSize": 36,
              "fontWeight": "bold",
              "fontColor": "#0B1220",
              "text": "title"
            },
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "width": "matchParent",
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "topMargin": 16,
              "fontSize": 17,
              "fontColor": "#475467",
              "text": "lead"
            },
            {
              "type": "Label",
              "width": "matchParent",
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "topMargin": 12,
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontColor": "#64748B",
              "text": "read_time"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "View",
          "id": "reference_test_tooling_content_with_rail",
          "orientation": "horizontal",
          "width": "matchParent",
          "height": "wrapContent",
          "child": [
            {
              "type": "View",
              "id": "reference_test_tooling_body_column",
              "orientation": "vertical",
              "weight": 1,
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "child": [
                {
                  "type": "View",
                  "orientation": "vertical",
                  "id": "section_matrix",
                  "width": "matchParent",
                  "height": "wrapContent",
                  "paddings": [24, 32, 24, 32],
                  "background": "#FFFFFF",
                  "child": [
                    { "type": "Label", "width": "matchParent", "height": "wrapContent", "fontSize": 26, "fontWeight": "bold", "fontColor": "#0B1220", "text": "section_matrix_heading" },
                    { "type": "Label", "width": "matchParent", "height": "wrapContent", "topMargin": 12, "fontSize": 16, "fontColor": "#475467", "text": "section_matrix_body" },
                    { "type": "Label", "width": "matchParent", "height": "wrapContent", "topMargin": 12, "fontSize": 14, "fontColor": "#475467", "text": "section_matrix_caption" },
                    {
                      "type": "CodeBlock",
                      "width": "matchParent",
                      "height": "wrapContent",
                      "topMargin": 12,
                      "code": "Feature                       | iOS                           | Android                   | Web\n------------------------------+-------------------------------+---------------------------+------------------------\nelement id -> automation id   | accessibilityIdentifier       | resource-id (testTag)     | HTML id (#id)\nscreen marker (assert screen) | 0.5x0.5 centred overlay       | 1.dp Box sibling          | data-screen on the root\nmarker build gate             | #if DEBUG                     | app FLAG_DEBUGGABLE       | NODE_ENV != production\n\"is displayed\" predicate      | exists && (hittable || alone) | findObject(By.res(...))   | attached && visible\npass / fail accessor          | result.allPassed              | TestSuiteResult.allPassed | allPassed(result)  [fn]\naddMedia action               | PhotoKit seed (sim only)      | into the gallery          | sets a file input\nemitHook action               | no-op + warning               | no-op + warning           | app-registered hooks\nopenedUrl assertion           | not supported                 | not supported             | window.open spy\ntap.retryTapIfNoChange        | applied                       | applied                   | accepted, no-op\nrecordings                    | Xcode auto (failures)         | record=true, per case     | Playwright video config\nlaunch.permissions            | UI-interruption monitor       | pm grant / pm revoke      | storage + cookies\nlaunch.clearState             | clear-state env               | pm clear                  | cookies + storage\nrun the tests with            | xcodebuild test               | gradlew connectedAndroid  | npx playwright test",
                      "language": "text",
                      "filename": "support matrix",
                      "showLineNumbers": false,
                      "copyable": false
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "View",
                  "orientation": "vertical",
                  "id": "section_ownership",
                  "width": "matchParent",
                  "height": "wrapContent",
                  "paddings": [24, 32, 24, 32],
                  "background": "#FFFFFF",
                  "child": [
                    { "type": "Label", "width": "matchParent", "height": "wrapContent", "fontSize": 26, "fontWeight": "bold", "fontColor": "#0B1220", "text": "section_ownership_heading" },
                    { "type": "Label", "width": "matchParent", "height": "wrapContent", "topMargin": 12, "fontSize": 16, "fontColor": "#475467", "text": "section_ownership_body" },
                    { "type": "Label", "width": "matchParent", "height": "wrapContent", "topMargin": 12, "fontSize": 14, "fontColor": "#475467", "text": "section_ownership_caption" },
                    {
                      "type": "CodeBlock",
                      "width": "matchParent",
                      "height": "wrapContent",
                      "topMargin": 12,
                      "code": "Moving part                              | Source of truth\n-----------------------------------------+------------------------------------------------\nTest schemas (screen/actions/flow/       | jsonui-test-runner  (schemas/)\n  results/description)                   |\nValidator constants (schema.py/report.py)| jsonui-cli\njsonui-test CLI                          | jsonui-cli  (test_tools/, bundled with jui)\nDrivers (iOS / Android / Web)            | each driver repo  (SPM / Maven Central / npm)\nmock.schema.json                         | jsonui-test-runner  (editor/doc only)\nschema <-> validator drift-check         | jsonui-cli CI  (test_schema_drift.py)",
                      "language": "text",
                      "filename": "ownership",
                      "showLineNumbers": false,
                      "copyable": false
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "View",
                  "orientation": "vertical",
                  "id": "reference_test_tooling_next",
                  "width": "matchParent",
                  "height": "wrapContent",
                  "paddings": [32, 32, 32, 32],
                  "background": "chrome_fill",
                  "child": [
                    { "type": "Label", "width": "matchParent", "height": "wrapContent", "fontSize": 24, "fontWeight": "bold", "fontColor": "chrome_ink", "text": "next_heading" },
                    {
                      "type": "Collection",
                      "id": "reference_test_tooling_next_collection",
                      "width": "matchParent",
                      "height": "wrapContent",
                      "topMargin": 20,
                      "columnCount": 2,
                      "lineSpacing": 16,
                      "itemSpacing": 16,
                      "lazy": "none",
                      "scrollEnabled": false,
                      "items": "@{nextReadLinks}",
                      "cellIdProperty": "id",
                      "sections": [
                        { "cell": "cells/next_step_card" }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "View",
                  "orientation": "vertical",
                  "id": "reference_test_tooling_footer",
                  "width": "matchParent",
                  "height": "wrapContent",
                  "paddings": [24, 32, 32, 32],
                  "background": "chrome_fill",
                  "child": [
                    { "type": "Label", "width": "matchParent", "height": "wrapContent", "fontSize": 12, "fontColor": "#94A3B8", "text": "footer_copyright" }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "View",
              "id": "reference_test_tooling_rail_column",
              "orientation": "vertical",
              "width": 260,
              "height": "wrapContent",
              "paddings": [24, 16, 24, 16],
              "child": [
                {
                  "type": "View",
                  "orientation": "vertical",
                  "id": "reference_test_tooling_toc_wrap",
                  "width": "matchParent",
                  "height": "wrapContent",
                  "paddings": [24, 32, 0, 32],
                  "background": "#F9FAFB",
                  "child": [
                    {
                      "type": "TableOfContents",
                      "width": "matchParent",
                      "height": "wrapContent",
                      "title": "toc_title",
                      "sticky": true,
                      "maxDepth": 1,
                      "items": [
                        { "id": "toc_matrix", "label": "toc_row_matrix", "anchor": "section_matrix", "level": 1 },
                        { "id": "toc_ownership", "label": "toc_row_ownership", "anchor": "section_ownership", "level": 1 }
                      ],
                      "stickyOffset": 80
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
